1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,000
You can navigate a PDF in Papol two ways:
with link history and anchors.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,800
Link history retraces jumps made by links
inside the paper.

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:16,000
Follow a link, then use Back and Forward
to move between locations.

4
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,725
The left and right bracket keys do the same.

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:25,300
When you want to move between two parts of a paper,
drop an anchor in each place.

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,975
The anchors appear in My anchors.
Click either anchor to go there.

7
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,100
Click a page label to name an anchor.

8
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:40,375
Turn an anchor into a note by selecting add a note,
writing your note, and saving it.

9
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,450
Enjoy Papol.
